# Security

- Never commit `.env`, private keys, bot tokens, or webhook secrets.
- Platform secrets: env / Fly secrets. Project-scoped OAuth tokens: Postgres only.
- Do not log tokens, private keys, session cookies, or Authorization headers.
- `/docs`, `/redoc`, OpenAPI stay disabled unless `ENV=development`.
- Treat webhook handlers as untrusted input; verify signatures (GitHub webhook secret).
- Channel attachment is the ingestion allowlist — do not broaden to whole-guild ingest.
- When adding allowlists for secret scanners, prefer path/example-file allowlists over disabling rules.
